WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:07.126
Here's one job in Bittings, from the first phone call to checkout, at the shop counter.

2
00:00:08.226 --> 00:00:18.238
A customer calls. She's lost the only key to her 2018 Ford F-150. Start a quick quote with her name and number.

3
00:00:19.338 --> 00:00:30.703
Pick the year, make and model. Bittings shows the keyway, the chip, how it programs, and the keys on your shelf that fit, with your price and how many you have.

4
00:00:31.803 --> 00:00:37.260
Add the key and the programming. The price is ready before she hangs up.

5
00:00:38.359 --> 00:00:45.785
She'll come into the shop, so put the job on the calendar in one tap. Everyone on the team can see it.

6
00:00:46.885 --> 00:00:53.735
When she arrives, ring it up at the register: the key, the programming, and a fob cover.

7
00:00:54.835 --> 00:01:00.840
She pays cash. Enter what she hands you, and Bittings shows the change.

8
00:01:01.940 --> 00:01:08.471
The sale is recorded, the receipt prints on the counter printer, and the key comes out of stock.

9
00:01:09.571 --> 00:01:17.521
At the end of the month, your sales, profit and pay are already added up, and the sales tax figures are ready.

10
00:01:18.621 --> 00:01:27.737
Bittings. Shop software built for locksmiths, by locksmiths. Request access at get bittings dot com.
